{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍愿意坚持那个决定，因为它确实让他从犹豫里动了起来。\",\n      \"key\": \"从犹豫里动了起来\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他确实感到过亲近和欢喜，不愿说那只是自己安慰自己。\",\n      \"key\": \"亲近和欢喜\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"那阵温暖让他舍不得放下亲近安稳的盼望，却也怕自己终究得不到。\",\n      \"key\": \"亲近安稳的盼望\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他反复追问还能怎么补，好像只要脑子不停，就不必承认自己有多难受。\",\n      \"key\": \"脑子不停\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还逼自己继续往前，却发现光靠行动过不上想要的亲近、安稳日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"逼自己继续往前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R14\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"从仍愿意坚持起句，保留决定曾让他走出犹豫的理由，删去重复的重新面对。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留过去的亲近和欢喜确实发生过，删去与前段重复的珍惜之物难再拥有，也不再用不能直接解释这点的跨段箭头。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留温暖带来的生活盼望与对愿望落空的担忧；将反复追问单独写出，接回压住难过、害怕撑不住的旧机制，不再重复同一层恐惧。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把行动的限度说具体，保留他仍逼自己向前，却无法单靠行动过上亲近安稳日子的矛盾。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dbd91fb8-fc66-4dc7-a77c-53bcb521121a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T071421559547Z", "elapsed_seconds": 462.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T07:22:03.739936+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fb22d37074603912554f3c766f7a5e26026c1e5800898ae848fea2eb98e0b4de", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T071421559547Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "645ccc93157f8cd9c7a9ca76c2